<h1 class="title">{% if title %}{{ title }}{% endif %} ({{ year }})</h1>
<p>
  As I finished university, I created personal branding materials to support my
  job search. This allowed me to focus on practical design and critically
  consider how to present myself. The cards I created turned into the jumping
  off point for the rest of my supplemental materials.
</p>

<h2>Process</h2>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p>
    Creating the Zam brand was quite fun as I got how I wanted to present myself
    to employers and friends. I began by considering what I wanted people to
    know about me. Facts, hobbies, intrestes and from there I decided I wanted
    an all-encompassing introduction to myself! I began to think about symbols
    and objects I come accross often. Colors and shapes I though would make me
    stand out.
  </p>
