<h2>Product</h2>
<div class="side-by-side">
  <p>
    The concept of the matchbox has been replaced by electric zappers and
    lighters. None of the modern options hold the same feeling as striking a
    match. By using a matchbox, I hope the keepsake expresses my creativity and
    ability to create memorable, personal design.
  </p>
